<title>POLAND: Best up 12 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Best up 12 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trader Best SA started trade on the Warsaw bourse's parallel market at 65 zlotys, 12,1 percent above issue price.</p>
<p>The firm's March initial public offering of 1.5 million shares at 58 zlotys was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>Last year Best had a net profit of 3.6 million zlotys on sales of 41.9 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
